OL,3,GNEWSASidecar passenger flown to
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 70s who was the
OL,7,Fpassenger in the sidecar was taken by
OL,8,Fair ambulance to Addenbrooke's Hospital
OL,9,Fin Cambridge and is now in a stable
OL,10,Fcondition.
OL,12,FThe rider of the motorbike, a man in
OL,13,Fhis 70s, was taken to the James Paget
OL,14,FHospital in Gorleston with minor
OL,15,Finjuries.
